    "postmark": "56 x 44 pt: outer rounded rect x 2.5, y 2.5, 51 x 39, radius 5, stroke 2; inner frame x 6, y 6, 44 x 25, radius 3, stroke 0.8; both in the stamp's ink, no fill.",
